---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Shutter Scotland | Privacy Protocol">
	<main style="background-color: #FAFAFA; min-height: 80vh; padding: 64px 48px; box-sizing: border-box;">
		<div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
			<span style="font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; background-color: #0A0A0A; color: #FAFAFA; padding: 2px 8px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;">LEGAL_02 // DATA PRIVACY</span>
			
			<h1 style="font-family: 'Arial Black', 'Impact', sans-serif; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 4.5rem); text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 0.9; letter-spacing: -0.05em; color: #0A0A0A; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 40px;">
				PRIVACY <br><span style="color: #FF4500;">PROTOCOL.</span>
			</h1>

			<div style="font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; color: #0A0A0A; line-height: 1.6; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 32px;">
				
				<div>
					<h3 style="font-family: 'Arial Black', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">01 // DATA COLLECTION ENGINE</h3>
					<p style="color: #3F3F46; margin: 0;">We only collect standard information explicitly provided by you via our Netlify intake booking form (Name, Email, Target Booking Date, and Camera Hardware State). This data is used purely to coordinate your tour confirmation.</p>
				</div>

				<div>
					<h3 style="font-family: 'Arial Black', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">02 // THIRD-PARTY INTEGRATION</h3>
					<p style="color: #3F3F46; margin: 0;">Once live booking configurations are activated, checkout processing will be safely handled natively via FareHarbor. We do not store financial details, credit card numbers, or transaction logging on our servers.</p>
				</div>

				<div>
					<h3 style="font-family: 'Arial Black', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">03 // ZERO LOG SELLING</h3>
					<p style="color: #3F3F46; margin: 0;">Your data is strictly confidential. We do not track cookies, buy user data profiles, or sell your email address to external marketing syndicates. System logs are purged regularly.</p>
				</div>

			</div>
		</div>
	</main>
</MainLayout>